/T (This report brings together feedback from the year ending 30 June 2026. It draws on three performance indicators: client satisfaction, likelihood to recommend and ease of working. The findings reflect both what we are doing well and where we can do better. We value the openness of our clients and remain focused on using this feedback to strengthen our collaboration and their overall experience.)
